        "original_id": "cdf7dd3c-601e-5632-a0da-b2051cc10476",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Bhasker, Kanye West, Jay-Z, Nate Ruess, Andrew Dost, Jack Antonoff\n- Groups: Fun.\n- Songs: \"Run This Town,\" \"All of the Lights,\" \"We Are Young,\" \"Carry On\"\n- Albums: My Beautiful Dark Twisted Fantasy\n- Roles: record producer, songwriter, keyboardist, vocalist, multi-instrumentalist\n- Awards: Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jeff Bhasker is an American record producer, songwriter, keyboardist, vocalist, and multi-instrumentalist, and he is also known as Billy Kraven and U.G.L.Y.\n- In 2010, \"All of the Lights\" was released as the fourth single from Kanye West's fifth studio album, My Beautiful Dark Twisted Fantasy.\n- Jeff Bhasker won Grammy Awards for the songs \"Run This Town\" by Jay-Z, \"All of the Lights\" by Kanye West, and \"We Are Young\" by Fun.\n- Jeff Bhasker was a writer of Fun.'s song \"Carry On\" alongside band members Nate Ruess, Andrew Dost, and Jack Antonoff, and he also produced the album containing the song.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
